SY_TALK("YtKW4ttwDvI",[[23,["Shri Mataji: Is it for the loudspeaker?","Yes."]],[36,["We can wait for some time more to organize."]],[47,["It is so unfortunate that it was not","published in the newspaper properly,"]],[53,["that day – it’s very unfortunate."]],[95,["Yogi: Excuse me Mother, I think to get","this microphone a little closer to you."]],[98,["Shri Mataji: Eh? Yogi: Do You want to get","this a little closer to You?"]],[101,["Shri Mataji: I’ll have it in My hand.","Yogi: You’ll take this in Your hand?"]],[104,["Shri Mataji: Yes.","Yogi: Okay."]],[111,["Shri Mataji: Then that won’t slip out,","you know. Yogi: Ah, okay."]],[121,["That’s ok, this. This is the one…"]],[235,["When we say in the newspaper or","in an advertisement"]],[242,["that you come to such and such hall","for your Self-realization,"]],[250,["I don’t know what people think about it."]],[255,["Perhaps they think that it is another","hocus-pocus"]],[265,["or some sort of a cult or some","money-making proposition."]],[277,["But there are some who may not think","that way,"]],[283,["but they want to have their Self-realization","and they come here."]],[292,["But one must understand that the attitude","we should have towards our Self"]],[300,["has to be really very earnest. To raise","your Kundalini is not so difficult"]],[309,["and to give you so-called realization","also not difficult,"]],[318,["in the sense that you can feel the cool","breeze of the Holy Ghost"]],[323,["coming out of the fontanel bone area,","you can get your baptism."]],[330,["But I call it \"so-called\""]],[334,["because the journey later is the difficult","thing, you see."]],[341,["If the attitude is not earnest, then you","just lose it in no time."]],[350,["So where the people are very ego-oriented -","I should say, convex personality is there -"]],[359,["it is even difficult to give realization","to begin with,"]],[363,["and even if you give realization,","to maintain it"]],[368,["and to make them grow is even more","difficult, much more difficult."]],[374,["Now sometimes Sahaja Yogis ask Me,","“Mother, how is it that in India"]],[378,["You may give realization to thousands","and they all stick on,"]],[383,["while here when You give realization","to people"]],[388,["they just come and go away, are all wasted","as described"]],[392,["in the parable of Christ of the seeds, that","some seeds just were lost on the rocks?”"]],[400,["So why it happens here?"]],[403,["I would not blame them, but I would say","that they have had no knowledge"]],[410,["what Self-realization is, how difficult","it is."]],[417,["If you read Patanjali’s “Yogashastra”","you’ll be surprised"]],[422,["how they were taught how to lead a good,","righteous life after marriage;"]],[431,["what was the relationship of a husband","and wife;"]],[435,["what was rhythm of sex life; how they","should treat their children;"]],[443,["how to develop their attention towards God","every day."]],[449,["All these things are absolutely missing","from the lives of people"]],[456,["who have turned their backs to God."]],[461,["Now, whatever you may try to turn","your backs to God or to your Self,"]],[466,["to your Spirit, it exists and it asserts","its own existence in you. It does."]],[475,["Even if you try to defy it and deny it,","it comes up,"]],[481,["and so people are seeking and seeking."]],[486,["The tragedy of the whole thing is that very","great seekers are born in the West"]],[492,["where people have no knowledge what is","Self-realization"]],[496,["and what one has to do to achieve it and","what a great blessing it is to have it."]],[502,["This is the biggest problem we face","all over and now as I am going to America"]],[507,["I also dread the same problem there."]],[511,["Now the thing is, people have full idea","as to the value of a diamond."]],[518,["They know if the diamond weighs so many","carats, it means this."]],[522,["If it is flawless, it means this. If it is","purest blue then it means this."]],[529,["But they don’t know the value of their","spiritual life;"]],[532,["they don’t know what it is to be spiritual.","Under these circumstances, naturally,"]],[539,["what happens that when even they get","Self-realization"]],[543,["they cannot stick on to Sahaja Yoga and","go further with it."]],[548,["Not that they lack in quality. I would say","it is not so."]],[553,["I would not say that they are the people","who are good for nothing,"]],[557,["they are not good for spiritual life.","So all the Sahaja Yogis must have"]],[561,["a very compassionate and understanding","attitude towards them,"]],[567,["that when they come to you they have","no knowledge about it."]],[571,["They are not trained that way. They are","not taught that way."]],[575,["I wish the people in the countries where","they have lost themselves"]],[580,["in the material gains should again read","some of these books into details"]],[586,["and try to find out what kind of life human","beings were supposed to lead"]],[591,["and what kind of life we are leading now."]],[595,["Now the word there is yama niyama, is a word","in the Patanjali Shastra, yama and niyama."]],[601,["The niyama are the rules for yourself,","what rules you have to observe."]],[607,["And what rules you have to observe","for others is yama,"]],[611,["where - how to deal with others, what","should be your relationship"]],[615,["to your wife, to your children, to other","relations that are there,"]],[619,["and how you must respect particular things"]],[622,["and to prepare yourself for","Self-realization, the ascent."]],[626,["All this balance has to be there if you","have to ascend in life."]],[631,["Even to lead a proper good life you have","to be like that."]],[636,["I tell you, if you go to India you’ll find","the country"]],[640,["hasn’t got any sanitation whatsoever,","hasn’t got all the food that you have,"]],[646,["hasn’t got any of your railways or any one","of these your telephones as they are."]],[651,["And when I go to India I forget that","there are telephones existing."]],[654,["They never use this for Me there. Everything","that is so dislocated, mismanaged,"]],[661,["all kinds of funny things are there.","Sometimes there is a drought."]],[664,["Sometimes there is a flood. All these","things are there."]],[668,["Despite that, people are existing only","because they know"]],[674,["how to lead a proper life, to adjust","themselves to natural things."]],[681,["Now the new disease that has come up","in America, AIDS,"]],[686,["has really upset Me very much. And I know","that it was to come, because today,"]],[692,["according to predictions it is not Kali","Yuga anymore, it is Kruta Yuga."]],[697,["Is the time when things will happen,"]],[700,["Kruta Yuga means when the spiritual powers","will work out."]],[704,["This is the time is already - you know that","in our books it is written"]],[708,["that the Kruta Yuga has started about sixty","years back, and that is how it is,"]],[714,["that now the spiritual powers are going","to react."]],[718,["It’s easy to say, “What’s wrong? Who is","God? We don’t believe in God.”"]],[722,["You’ll have to pay for that."]],[725,["If you go against the nature you’ll have","to pay for it."]],[729,["If you do things according to your own ego,","you’ll have to pay for it."]],[734,["This is the time that has come. This is","for our good."]],[738,["This is not for our bad,"]],[740,["because it has been told many-a-times","not to do certain things."]],[744,["Of course, in the Western countries where","Christianity is followed"]],[748,["is precisely told not to do this, not to do","that."]],[752,["But then people say, “Why they have","said it?”"]],[755,["The only difference is that in the East","it is explained"]],[758,["why not to do this, why not to do that,"]],[762,["what happens. It has gone into the details","of it."]],[765,["But I must say here also people know that","this is not to be done."]],[771,["But when you talk about these things,","“This is not to be done”,"]],[774,["they will brand you as Victorian, or","they’ll mock at you,"]],[777,["laugh at you, make fun of you."]],[779,["But when they face all these things","happening to you,"]],[784,["then they don’t know where to go, what","to do and how to face up to it."]],[790,["This is the time where the spiritual powers","are going to work out;"]],[796,["they are going to prove the existence","of God."]],[798,["They are going to prove the existence","of Divine laws and their operation."]],[805,["They are going to prove all that is said","in all the religions,"]],[809,["their unity, and their integration.","Everything is going to be proved now today."]],[815,["Even if you say this many-a-times,","many people will not pay any heed to it."]],[820,["They will say, “Oh, Mother is just","brainwashing us.”"]],[822,["That’s what people told Me when I came","first to England."]],[826,["That I said, “This is not the life human","beings should lead."]],[829,["Even for animals it is not suitable.","How can you dare into these things"]],[834,["and get involved into problems? Later on","it will be showing results.”"]],[840,["But nobody was willing to listen to Me at","that time and everybody was angry with Me."]],[845,["They said, “This woman is matronly.”","There are certain words in English"]],[849,["which are very condemning. Like first","one of them is Victorian."]],[853,["If you are Victorian you are a gone case,","absolutely,"]],[856,["that you are branded on; then you","can’t talk."]],[859,["But I would say even Victorian was better,","where there was some hypocrisy I agree."]],[864,["Hypocrisy is a bad thing. But shamelessness","is much worse."]],[869,["If you become shameless the thing spreads","like fire. There is no protection."]],[877,["Hypocrisy is at least a little protection","from the spreading of it."]],[881,["And everybody today thinks what’s wrong","in it,"]],[886,["and I, when I came here, I had such","a shock."]],[889,["I couldn’t believe that human beings could","go to that extent to ruin themselves."]],[894,["This is ruinous, absolutely ruinous it is."]],[899,["And when a person like Christ, who was","nothing but purity, said"]],[903,["that, “Thou shalt not have adulterous","eyes”;"]],[906,["to that extent, to that subtle extent","of purity He talked -"]],[910,["I was amazed how people have denied Him","completely and how all other people"]],[916,["like Jews, like even Hindus here,","Christians, every sort of people"]],[923,["didn’t think what they were professing,","what they were claiming and what they were."]],[930,["Today again, one-by-one you will see","more results of wrongdoings to yourself."]],[936,["This is because you have crossed","all the limits of niyamas,"]],[940,["how you should be to yourself. Everyone","seems to be sick today,"]],[944,["either mentally or physically. Why?"]],[948,["Why are they mentally sick there? This is","the physical side of it."]],[952,["The mental side is, they can run into","any sort of thing like witchcraft,"]],[958,["like spiritualism, like any guru who comes","and talks about God,"]],[963,["without finding out the credibility of it,","without finding out"]],[967,["what others have achieved by it."]],[970,["Not only that, but I have seen people","after being harmed very much,"]],[976,["who have been tortured by these gurus,"]],[980,["who have been completely made beggars","by these gurus,"]],[986,["still profess, still fight for those gurus,"]],[991,["as if they have lost all their freedom,","all their independence to fight it back."]],[998,["The other day one lady came to tell Me"]],[1002,["that she went to a relation’s place to stay","with her,"]],[1006,["and the relation was so funny that she","wouldn’t even give them full food to eat,"]],[1012,["and in the house there was limited food,","and she would lock up everything"]],[1018,["and they really starved themselves, you","see. But she – I knew her very well –"]],[1022,["so she telephoned to Me. I said, “You come","along to My house,” and just called her"]],[1025,["and I was amazed why these things happened","in the life of that woman."]],[1030,["How could she do it? She had no conscience!","Somebody starving next door to her."]],[1035,["The reason was she was a drunkard.","She used to drink a lot."]],[1040,["Her husband used to drink. Now with the","amount of money they earn you cannot drink."]],[1046,["Is a simple thing, leave alone all","the other side of it."]],[1051,["And she was drinking, her husband was","also drinking."]],[1054,["And they, whatever money they have,","they don’t eat much, they just drink,"]],[1059,["and they were waiting for this woman","to disappear."]],[1061,["Because once you become enslaved to one","particular madness like this,"]],[1066,["like drinking or anything, then you forget","all your relationships"]],[1070,["with all your other duties that you have","to perform."]],[1074,["It’s like one madman, you see, doing work","like mad,"]],[1078,["has no consideration of relationships"]],[1081,["or any duties that he has to perform","with others."]],[1085,["Then also he has no time to think about","the duties towards himself."]],[1091,["He becomes such a dry personality that","he has no conscience even."]],[1096,["And he just shuts up his mind from all","that is gracious,"]],[1103,["all that is sublime, all that is compassion.","He is just busy with himself."]],[1108,["He wants to drink. He wants to drink,","that’s all."]],[1112,["Very seriously he’ll say, “Yes, I have","to drink now. I like it”."]],[1116,["So it doesn’t matter if his dog doesn’t get","the food"]],[1121,["or if his children have to starve or if","they have to work on the streets."]],[1126,["He doesn’t mind because he has to drink."]],[1129,["Then there is another thing, like today","I saw so many people enjoying cricket –"]],[1134,["I Myself can enjoy cricket very well and I","understand cricket very well."]],[1139,["But how much time do they pay to themselves","in the sense they are just enjoying"]],[1146,["what is something entertaining. But what","about the entertainment of your Spirit?"]],[1155,["Have you thought of your Spirit at all?","Have you ever peeped into yourself"]],[1162,["and found out that there is Spirit, which","has to be satisfied and entertained?"]],[1167,["And once you entertain that Spirit you","don’t need any entertainment."]],[1170,["If you have it, well and good, if you don’t","have it, well and good."]],[1173,["That is the highest type of entertainment.","That’s the highest type of enjoyment."]],[1178,["That’s the highest life that one can","ask for."]],[1183,["So all these things come to a level where,","“What’s wrong?"]],[1188,["What’s wrong in this and what’s wrong","in that?”"]],[1191,["So the nature is now going to show you","what’s wrong."]],[1196,["Because intelligently you understand,","rationally you understand,"]],[1201,["logically you understand it is wrong."]],[1203,["But still there is somebody else who says,","“What’s wrong?”"]],[1208,["So now, experiencing it you understand."]],[1213,["That’s the only way left for nature","to make you understand:"]],[1216,["now experience it, suffer it."]],[1221,["There is another way, is that you can","experience your Spirit."]],[1228,["Also it’s possible only this Krita Yuga can","do that,"]],[1233,["that you can experience the enjoyment","of your Spirit."]],[1237,["Both things are there. When it does","one thing, it does the other way also."]],[1243,["It also gives you the experience","of reality, the experience of truth,"]],[1251,["the life that is eternal, and that’s what","one has to look forward to."]],[1257,["But enslavement has to be brought down","to a proper shape, little bit."]],[1263,["That also it does. I was amazed some people"]],[1266,["who had been drunkards and alcoholics,","in Sahaja Yoga they came;"]],[1270,["next day they left it. It does that."]],[1274,["Enslavement of any kind, of any habit,","is detrimental to our growth in Spirit."]],[1281,["It is detrimental, but doesn’t matter:","if you have some habits"]],[1285,["they just drop out, as you have seen.","Sahaja Yoga is such a kind, compassionate"]],[1290,["happening that it really makes you"]],[1295,["a different person who is a master","of himself; no more enslavement."]],[1302,["All this slavishness goes away. All this","fear disappears."]],[1310,["You become master of yourself and in that","mastery you are the master of love,"]],[1315,["master of compassion, master of wisdom.","This should happen to all of us."]],[1322,["You are all due for it. You are","created for it."]],[1326,["You all have evolved for it. You have","to have it."]],[1330,["But there are so many misidentifications","in us"]],[1333,["with which we are drawn to wrong things,"]],[1336,["to things which are anti-God, which are","anti-Spirit."]],[1341,["So many things are there which divert","your mind to that"]],[1346,["because you have drawn certain conclusions","about reality."]],[1350,["You think this is the reality. You believe","that this is the reality"]],[1354,["and you want to stick on to that. But that","is not so."]],[1360,["I tell you, you have to understand that","reality is what it is."]],[1366,["You should face it and enjoy it. Don’t try","to put your ideas on it."]],[1372,["Don’t try to organize the reality. It is","what it is."]],[1375,["And once you decide within yourself,","“So far I have not known"]],[1379,["and I have to know,” with that humility,","you’ll get it."]],[1384,["It doesn’t mean that you have to surrender","your money or anything,"]],[1388,["your self-respect or your freedom.","On the contrary, you have to enter"]],[1393,["into that area where there is supreme","freedom, supreme freedom."]],[1400,["You are not free. If you think you are","free, you are sadly mistaken,"]],[1405,["because we are still slaves of so many","things."]],[1410,["But once a person is free he is not","bothered about anything."]],[1415,["Nothing can make him habituated","to anything. Nothing."]],[1421,["Such a person lives like a king, whether","he is in a hut, on a street or in a palace."]],[1427,["He is not bothered. Whatever it is he is","the king. He doesn’t want anything anymore."]],[1432,["He gives. He gives. He’s so rich that","nobody can give him anything."]],[1437,["He gives and gives and gives."]],[1440,["And only thing that it can do is to give;","it cannot take anything."]],[1445,["The capacity is such that he cannot take","anything from anyone."]],[1450,["No more these attitudes, how to save money,","how to save your labor,"]],[1455,["how to save your chairs, your powers,","your positions."]],[1460,["Nothing remains there, because you are","the master of everything."]],[1464,["Nothing is more important than your own","Spirit, which you enjoy, which manifests."]],[1473,["It’s so fortunate that you are born","at a time when it is Krita Yuga,"]],[1477,["and you have taken your birth deliberately","to get this realization."]],[1482,["That’s why you are here. But how many","realize that you have to come"]],[1488,["to terms with many things? You have to seek","the truth and not the untruth."]],[1496,["You don’t have to run after people who","make fools out of you"]],[1502,["or those who try to pamper your ego,"]],[1506,["or who put spirits in you, and make useless","cabbages."]],[1510,["You have to become something greater,","healthier, mightier"]],[1518,["and loving, affectionate, compassionate."]],[1523,["That should be the picture of","the personality that has to evolve"]],[1528,["out of human beings. Otherwise we cannot","save this world."]],[1531,["With the kind of people we have we cannot","save."]],[1534,["They are all compromising, they are all","manipulating, maneuvering"]],[1539,["as if they are all getting drowned, and","everybody has to somehow or other"]],[1543,["pull out the person ahead of them","to come up."]],[1547,["All funny things happening in this world.","That is only because we are so insecured."]],[1554,["The insecurity will all go away once the","light – the light of your Spirit shines."]],[1562,["Let the light shine through and see your","beauty and glory and your strength"]],[1568,["of that great power of love of God","within yourself"]],[1573,["and then you’ll be amazed what it is."]],[1576,["As you know, Sahaja Yoga is not one","lecture, is not two,"]],[1582,["can be hundreds, but the happening takes","[a] split of a second. It should happen."]],[1588,["Once it happens you can achieve","your realization"]],[1596,["in such a way that you won’t even feel it."]],[1600,["But afterwards you have to put in","deliberations."]],[1604,["You have to look after yourself. You have","to respect yourself and go ahead with it."]],[1610,["There’s no use arguing about it. Even if","you argue I can take you up to a point"]],[1616,["because this is the realm beyond the mind,","because mind is a limited thing."]],[1622,["We have to achieve the unlimited and","for that a happening has to take place."]],[1627,["We can’t promise you that it will take","place. If it takes place, well and good,"]],[1632,["we can help you in a way to achieve it, but","we cannot be sure that it will happen."]],[1640,["So be in a receptive mood and be kind","to yourself and achieve your realization."]],[1647,["This is the last time I’m speaking now","in London."]],[1650,["For quite some time I won’t be here, maybe","in November if I come for a short time;"]],[1658,["I may be in London, may be outside London,","somewhere in England; I can’t say."]],[1664,["I hope all those who are today should","decide that if they have"]],[1670,["to achieve their realization as a permanent","blessing from God,"]],[1675,["then they have to go further with it.","You cannot just stop it at this meeting."]],[1680,["You have to go further with it with greater","enquiries. You have to go"]],[1684,["to different ashrams and centers that","we have; you have to work it out."]],[1688,["If you are a big man, like the other day","somebody came as a managing director"]],[1692,["and tried to be funny, I said, “If you are","a managing director"]],[1694,["this is not the place for you.” God doesn’t","understand. You may be the king."]],[1699,["You might be the president. You might","be anyone."]],[1701,["God doesn’t understand these man-made","positions. God’s positions are different"]],[1706,["and if you have to enter into the Kingdom","of God come as a humble person."]],[1711,["Give up all your ideas about your big","positions and big education and all that."]],[1715,["Be a humble person. If you are humble","then it will work out,"]],[1721,["and not only that it will work out but","it is the only chance"]],[1727,["we human beings have to change the whole","world. There’s no other chance I can see."]],[1732,["I hope all of you will pay full attention","to it"]],[1739,["and ardently, with full devotion, seek your","Self and its ascent and its establishment."]],[1747,["May God bless you all."]],[1752,["If you have any questions you can ask","Me today."]],[1783,["Yes. Seeker: Shri Mataji, could you say","something about collective"]],[1788,["and the need for people who have been","realized to be together?"]],[1795,["Shri Mataji: What did he say?"]],[1799,["Yogi: Mother, could you please say","something about the collective"]],[1804,["and the need for realized souls to be","together?"]],[1807,["Shri Mataji: Oh, all right. That’s a very","nice suggestion."]],[1811,["I would like to say something about","collectivity."]],[1816,["So far as you know, in the history of","spirituality people have got realization."]],[1822,["Many people have got it. One after another,","many people got it"]],[1829,["but I would say one in a million, one","in a ten million, like that,"]],[1839,["because we have to have some people to talk","about it, to begin with."]],[1845,["We always see what was written","in the past, you see,"]],[1849,["but those people who got realization","single-handed suffered a lot,"]],[1855,["and they could not transmit what it was","needed to be given to others"]],[1861,["in a way that would be acceptable."]],[1866,["Now as you see, any discovery is made,","like that people can benefit individually."]],[1874,["Every person can say, “Oh, I have got it.","So I can have it in my house,” you see;"]],[1879,["but it is of no value. It is of no value,","I can tell you."]],[1884,["I would say a personality like Christ came","on this earth. We had Christianity;"]],[1889,["what have they done about it? I mean,","it’s a sad affair."]],[1893,["I mean, to think such a personality to come","and what a great job He has done"]],[1897,["to establish Himself on Agnya chakra,","what people have done out of it, you see."]],[1902,["The reason was He was seldom; He was","alone. It was not a mass thing."]],[1907,["That was not the time, because He had","to establish this center."]],[1910,["Without that it could not be mass,","all right?"]],[1912,["It could not be an en masse realization","but He talked about,"]],[1916,["“You have to be born again,” and all that.","But the whole thing fizzled out"]],[1920,["because they could not get to the essence","of it."]],[1924,["One person of that caliber coming","on this earth"]],[1929,["found it impossible to convince people","and talk about it."]],[1934,["So one has to understand that anything","that is evolutionary"]],[1942,["first happens to one or two persons only,","but then it happens to many people."]],[1949,["Now in Sahaja Yoga there’s another problem","apart from that, that it is happening"]],[1953,["to many people, it is there, no doubt.","Thousands are getting realization,"]],[1957,["it’s no doubt. It’s working out that way,"]],[1960,["that now the evolution has come to this","stage, as I say it’s the blossom time,"]],[1964,["many flowers are there and they have","to become the fruits."]],[1967,["But now why is it necessary to have","collectivity when people are getting"]],[1972,["realization like that, is a very important","point one has to understand."]],[1977,["The thing is that now, when you are getting","realized, what is happening to you?"]],[1984,["You are getting related to the whole."]],[1987,["Our microcosm is getting related","to the macrocosm."]],[1991,["Say your body is there and you are","sleeping. First you get a little awakening."]],[1998,["You open your fingers, all right? Then you","open your, another finger."]],[2003,["Now there is a little trouble on your","finger and you can’t see anything."]],[2009,["So you open your eyes and you pay your","attention to your hands."]],[2013,["So that trouble may be all right but you","need another hand to help me."]],[2018,["So you want the another hand also to be","awakened to that point, like that."]],[2023,["So when the Sahaja Yogis are getting","awakened more and more, you see,"]],[2028,["the problems that are facing us, we can","solve them better,"]],[2031,["because so many people are working out","the problem."]],[2034,["Do you understand My point now? Together!","When we are together"]],[2039,["we understand now there’s a problem,","now I’m going to America."]],[2044,["I’ve gone in 1970 - 1973 first, I think,","yes."]],[2052,["1973 I went first. I was alone! I mean,","I gave them very good lectures,"]],[2059,["we had very big halls filled up and","everything – but everything fizzled out."]],[2063,["The reason is the people who got","realization didn’t have anybody"]],[2067,["to look after them, there was nobody","to support them, give them assistance,"]],[2071,["so they got lost. I mean, they are there,","some of them are here and there."]],[2076,["Now what has happened now? Today when","I’m going to America everybody is praying."]],[2083,["In Australia they are praying. In India","they are praying."]],[2088,["Like attention, you’ll be surprised some","people are coming from India"]],[2091,["to go down to America. Some are coming","from Australia to go down to America."]],[2095,["Some are coming from France, some","from Switzerland."]],[2098,["They are all rushing to America.","Now the job is in America."]],[2102,["All right, so, like the attention you see,","as soon as somebody pricks Me here,"]],[2106,["My hand goes there, My head goes there,","everything works it out."]],[2110,["So the collective working-out effort","is going to solve the problem."]],[2116,["But supposing if this finger is fighting","with this finger, can I write anything?"]],[2121,["Or if they are secluded and alone,","can I use them?"]],[2126,["All this body has to become absolutely","in concord with each other."]],[2133,["But so many are still sleeping. Those who","are awakened at least must stick together."]],[2140,["Otherwise Sahaja Yoga cannot work out."]],[2143,["Today I find it much easier to give","realization, much easier."]],[2147,["I was struggling with six people for four","years in your London."]],[2152,["Four years, six people. But once they got","realization it started working faster"]],[2158,["and the more people we get – because","the channel that is to be used"]],[2164,["is like nerves in the body. You become","a nerve of that body which is awakened,"]],[2170,["and once the nerves start working out","together"]],[2173,["realizing that there’s one force that is","flowing through them,"]],[2176,["all of you have to work it out together","with understanding of the Divine."]],[2184,["It works faster. Any person whose all","nerves are at work"]],[2188,["will be much more dynamic than a person","who is half-dead or is full-dead."]],[2195,["So you can understand how collectivity","is important."]],[2199,["Then another thing is that going to","a very enjoyable part of it,"]],[2206,["that when the Sahaja Yogis are collectively","there, they really enjoy."]],[2212,["Because for the first time you start","enjoying human beings, first time."]],[2217,["Before this you never enjoyed them."]],[2218,["You enjoyed flowers, you enjoyed everything","else, but not human beings."]],[2222,["Pure enjoyment of human beings starts","coming when you become fully realized."]],[2228,["I’ll give you an example. We went","to Calcutta for one day"]],[2232,["and I was in a room in one hotel"]],[2237,["and there were three, four Sahaja Yogis","in another hotel - another room,"]],[2242,["and one gentleman came to Me","for his realization."]],[2247,["And when I raised his thing, the Kundalini,","you see, they all got vibrated"]],[2251,["and they all rushed to My room"]],[2255,["to know “What has happened, suddenly how","is it we got such joy within ourselves”."]],[2260,["They came to see, and this man was there.","He was a great soul"]],[2264,["and they felt the vibrations, tremendous,","you see."]],[2266,["So it is not the happening of an individual.","It is the happening of the whole."]],[2272,["And the individual effort is going to be","absolutely useless."]],[2275,["It will be all neutralized. If you sit","at home, do your meditation,"]],[2279,["it won’t work out. You won’t go very far.","Because the whole has to come up."]],[2285,["I’ll give an example that when you churn","the butter -"]],[2293,["in India, I don’t know, we don’t do that","way; we do it very naturally –"]],[2297,["you put a little butter inside that and","then again you start churning."]],[2303,["So the butter starts gathering round that","butter, all of it comes together."]],[2308,["But some particles are left out. They stick","to the sides, stick to that."]],[2313,["They are no more as butter; they are thrown","away as buttermilk. Is as simple as that."]],[2319,["You see, the more you gather together,","you really enjoy the spirit of friendship,"]],[2326,["spirit of mirth, spirit of love in pure","form. So far the love is biased."]],[2337,["There’s sex, there’s lust, there’s money,","there’s this, there’s relationship."]],[2343,["This is, “You are British; so I must love","you,” “I am Indian;"]],[2346,["so I must love you.” All these nonsensical","barriers are there."]],[2349,["There you love a human being because","he is a human being"]],[2353,["and he is a yogi, speaks the same language."]],[2357,["Now today I have attended a wedding party","and the bride and the bridegroom said,"]],[2363,["“We are coming to Paris with you, Mother.","There are hundred people coming to Paris,"]],[2367,["because we have to change Paris”, you see.","“But,” I said, “you are recently married."]],[2371,["Now better enjoy your honeymoon.”","They said, “What are we going to enjoy?"]],[2374,["We’ll enjoy there our honeymoon”,","so they are coming up there."]],[2377,["Even if I tell them, “You don’t come,”","they won’t listen."]],[2380,["They will enjoy their honeymoon there only."]],[2382,["I never said, “You come”, on the contrary,","I’m saying, “You go away."]],[2385,["I will give you money to enjoy your","honeymoon wherever you feel like.”"]],[2387,["They wouldn’t go, because they know","where enjoyment lies,"]],[2390,["with their brothers, with friends and","sisters. It’s absolutely so,"]],[2395,["I tell you, that the enjoyment of human","beings has not been there."]],[2402,["Now there are people who live in India,","who live in Australia,"]],[2406,["who live here, all over the places,"]],[2409,["but when the Sahaja Yogis go to India","you should see them,"]],[2413,["the way the Sahaja Yogis in the villages,","the way they embrace them,"]],[2419,["the way they feel the oneness. Never","they have felt like this for a white skin."]],[2423,["If they saw a white skin they would just","run away"]],[2425,["and hide themselves under this thing,","you see. And even now"]],[2429,["people are sometimes frightened to see","a white skin in a village."]],[2431,["They say, “Oh, God, they have come just","to destroy us!” or something like that."]],[2434,["But now that’s over. Now it’s a human","being, a human being is coming."]],[2438,["They are all embracing. For there is","nothing like a black or a white"]],[2442,["or anything left now. It’s such a love that","grows and an understanding."]],[2450,["That’s only possible if you learn how","to live collectively."]],[2454,["And collectivity also teaches you where","you are. Very important it is."]],[2460,["A person who has not lived collectively","cannot understand."]],[2463,["I have seen people who have their own","families, live with their families,"]],[2467,["they are Sahaja Yogis - but once they come","to the ashram"]],[2471,["they know they are not yet there."]],[2474,["Because you have to adjust, you have","to learn to adjust,"]],[2478,["you can’t have private bathroom","to yourself, private room to yourself."]],[2484,["All right, you can have if you want to have,","but you should also know how to adjust."]],[2488,["As you know, I live very comfortably","Myself,"]],[2491,["but if it comes to living I can live","anywhere,"]],[2493,["I have no problem of comfort or anything."]],[2496,["In the same way we are not barred from","enjoyment. Because of all these things,"]],[2501,["the way we carry our bathrooms with us,","we do not enjoy life."]],[2505,["[You] see, [you] want to have everything","absolutely first class that has, say,"]],[2509,["that even when we go to the picnic we take","all the metropolitan with us."]],[2513,["In the same way we cannot enjoy life.","We cannot enjoy nature."]],[2516,["We cannot enjoy anything as long as we","become just an individual,"]],[2522,["“Oh, I am the one who is going to get it.”"]],[2526,["The last of all we must know by","individualism we become malignant."]],[2531,["I don’t say become communist, because","that’s another malignancy;"]],[2535,["but by becoming individuals we become","malignant. What is malignancy?"]],[2539,["That an individual cell takes up upon","itself, “I will grow, I will grow.”"]],[2544,["It doesn’t know how to grow with the whole.","It has no coordination with the whole."]],[2548,["That’s why you say it is a cancer."]],[2552,["Cancer is nothing but is a malignant cell","which is alone"]],[2555,["and is saying that, “I have to achieve it.","I can do it, I can manage it”."]],[2562,["And once it starts growing like that,"]],[2565,["whosoever it touches, that person becomes","the same."]],[2569,["All these ideas – we are higher race","or we are greater people,"]],[2573,["we are moneyed people, we are something","special,"]],[2577,["we are of this club – all this disappears."]],[2581,["It’s all nonsensical. We are identified","with nonsensical things"]],[2586,["and making ourselves miserable and others","also miserable."]],[2591,["And then you give up all that. Suddenly","you find, “Oh, what enjoyment!”"]],[2595,["You don’t want anything, you just want","to be in the company of Sahaja Yogis."]],[2602,["I have seen people, ambassadors, very","highly placed people,"]],[2606,["just getting lost with the Sahaja Yogis."]],[2610,["The other day I had a businessman from","Bombay. I took him down with Me"]],[2614,["to a place called Gurai; and it was all","in a mess,"]],[2622,["in the sense there were no proper","bathrooms, there were…"]],[2625,["It was just like a God-forsaken place,","I tell you."]],[2629,["And there weren’t even places to sit down","properly,"]],[2633,["only the beach and the palm trees and all","sorts of thing was there."]],[2638,["And the man got lost into that, absolutely","lost."]],[2641,["And he said, “I never wanted this day","to finish."]],[2644,["Is the only day I’ve really enjoyed myself","thoroughly”."]],[2648,["Because there was such spontaneity,","such spontaneous love,"]],[2654,["such attention and such purity","in the atmosphere."]],[2660,["To enjoy that purity you have to be","in the collective."]],[2665,["Sitting down in the room, you can’t","understand, there is no reflection of you."]],[2669,["You can’t understand where are you,","how far you are going."]],[2673,["Collectivity is the most important thing,"]],[2675,["and those who try to break the collectivity","are doing anti-Sahaja activity."]],[2681,["[You] see, we call it a-Sahaja movement","or you can say a-Sahaja activitiy."]],[2688,["You have to be one with the whole. Those","who have tried to separate themselves,"]],[2693,["all of them go down in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2697,["Try to be one with everyone, to share","and enjoy everybody’s being,"]],[2705,["because God has created you so beautifully.","You are so beautiful."]],[2710,["And the enjoyment should not be lost","because you have certain barriers;"]],[2715,["like some people can’t take out their","shoes, I mean, just imagine"]],[2718,["how much they are identified with their","shoes."]],[2722,["They can’t take out their shoes. To that","extent they are stupid!"]],[2726,["[You] see, all this kind of stupidity","drops out"]],[2728,["once you meet really wise people","around you."]],[2732,["To get rid of all these nonsensical ideas,","which have really"]],[2737,["haunted your head all these days, you get","rid of them"]],[2742,["and you really enjoy everyone, whether","he is a doorman or he is a chairman,"]],[2750,["all of them are men for you. It’s nothing","more than that."]],[2754,["All that drops out and you start enjoying","your Self."]],[2759,["That’s why collectivity is the only way","I can work out Sahaja Yoga."]],[2764,["I can’t think I can work out through","the people who are separated, divided."]],[2771,["It is said, Christ has said also that…","They said, “What have we to do?”"]],[2777,["He said, “When you love each other you have","done the greatest justice to Me”."]],[2783,["It’s true. And when I hear the loving","conversation of the Sahaja Yogis"]],[2788,["I feel the happiest. That’s the greatest","happiness for Me,"]],[2791,["that all of you should love each other","in purity, without any return,"]],[2796,["only for love’s sake you all should love","each other. And that is what it is!"]],[2802,["And also Krishna has said, “Wherever people","are there gathered together"]],[2806,["in the name of God, I reside within them”."]],[2809,["So in that joint - so-called joint, because","you are all one,"]],[2813,["moving with one rhythm, with one","understanding, with one language,"]],[2818,["so you all should always meet, call each","other and have rapport with each other."]],[2823,["It’s so beautiful. It’s musical.","It’s poetical."]],[2829,["Do you understand that? May God bless you."]],[2838,["And see for yourself when you cut out","your collectivity."]],[2842,["Just abuse yourself at that point. That","this is one thing"]],[2845,["you are trying to teach Me now, I’m not","going to listen to this nonsense."]],[2850,["We are collective being otherwise also.","I mean, we cannot,"]],[2854,["people cannot take even drinks without","somebody being there."]],[2858,["You can’t take your food alone.","In so many things,"]],[2861,["I mean, if you are not absolutely","a recluse you can’t live alone."]],[2867,["Then in religion, in the seeking,"]],[2870,["especially in the realm of God,","how can it be?"]],[2876,["You all have to be there."]],[2886,["I think it was a very good question,","rightly asked."]],[2889,["This individualism must be given up."]],[2894,["That doesn’t mean you all should dress up","like military people –"]],[2898,["that’s not necessary –"]],[2901,["or you should all behave in the same","manner – that’s not necessary."]],[2905,["Variety brings all the beauty. But that","doesn’t mean that"]],[2908,["if I say it is East you should say","it is West."]],[2918,["That’s the main trouble is, I think,","isn’t it?"]],[2926,["That you can’t agree to each other."]],[2930,["What’s the problem in collectivity,","you think."]],[2938,["I can ask the question."]],[2951,["Must get out of individual limitations."]],[2967,["I think everybody should for some time go","and live in an ashram, is a good idea."]],[2971,["But ashram must be such where there is","collectivity."]],[2973,["In the ashram if they are fighting and","quarrelling -"]],[2980,["then what’s the use of being in the ashram","also? But I leave it to you."]],[2984,["It’s all freedom to you. You just decide","yourself."]],[2988,["I have not put any rules and regulations","on you much,"]],[2992,["because I want you to use your wisdom","and put everything right yourself."]],[2999,["You are all very wise people but must","have concord."]],[3005,["Listen to others. Talk to them. Find out","what’s the problem is."]],[3010,["On small, small things people fight.","It’s a very wrong thing."]],[3013,["Moreover, you have to have one person","as a leader to whom you should listen to."]],[3019,["If I find that fellow is useless I’ll throw","him away. You know that very well."]],[3022,["Throw him away, not in the way people","throw away,"]],[3025,["but he’ll just get out of Sahaja Yoga.","You know that very well."]],[3027,["So there should be no problem. But","everybody should not"]],[3031,["try to dominate each other. That’s","a wrong idea."]],[3036,["Try to change your attitude. As I would","say, how far can you adjust?"]],[3043,["How far can you accommodate? Let’s see","that way."]],[3048,["You have to learn that from Me, isn’t it?"]],[3054,["You must find out ways and methods of","accommodating yourself with others."]],[3058,["Just try to learn. It’s not difficult.","That’s the whole attitude of life,"]],[3064,["is of competition and this and that - should","be changed. You must compete in loving,"]],[3069,["compete in doing good things, compete","at working for others."]],[3073,["Like “I’ve opened the door, now I’ll not","take the phone”. Is very common."]],[3078,["“I’ve washed the things this morning, then","I will not wash in the evening”."]],[3084,["Then people start taking advantage as this.","Let them take advantage;"]],[3087,["it is a disadvantage for them. Actually,","if you see the other side,"]],[3096,["compete in service, compete in love,","compete in good things,"]],[3101,["of saying good words, of communicating","in a sweeter way"]],[3106,["that others feel happy, making others","happy."]],[3110,["Try to change your attitude towards others"]],[3117,["and you’ll really enjoy, I tell you, you’ll","enjoy. That’s the way."]],[3120,["You know, if you say something to hurt","someone and upset someone,"]],[3124,["it must be upsetting you definitely.","You may not show but it must be,"]],[3128,["because whatever you do to others comes","back to you. Straightforward march,"]],[3132,["I tell you. It doesn’t stay there","altogether; it comes back to you."]],[3139,["So just try to be kind to others."]],[3143,["You may say that the other may try to harm","you, doesn’t matter."]],[3146,["Nobody can harm you because you are","the Spirit. Who can harm you?"]],[3150,["You are the Spirit. So just try","to understand the person."]],[3155,["I tell you, after some time you’ll find","that person will become very soft."]],[3159,["So many Sahaja Yogis have become like","that automatically."]],[3162,["They all are here for seeking God,","isn’t it?"]],[3165,["So to help them you have to be patient."]],[3170,["Give up your old methods and ways,","I must tell you:"]],[3173,["to be curt, to be stern, to be angry,","there’s no need at all!"]],[3182,["I’m telling you from My experience.","I’ve tried all these things."]],[3186,["It works, isn’t it? It does work."]],[3193,["And you have to have faith in them and","faith in their ascent, in their quality."]],[3202,["I like people who praise others to Me.","I don’t like people who criticize others."]],[3208,["Try to support each other, help each other"]],[3213,["and never talk about their past or anything","like that; it’s very sad."]],[3219,["Sometimes I’ve seen people are very hard","and in anger they say things"]],[3224,["which one should never say. It’s not","gracious."]],[3226,["It’s not in the mannerism of Sahaja Yogis.","You should never say these things."]],[3232,["Do I ever say anything like that to you","about your past?"]],[3236,["When you write to Me, even if I know","everything about you,"]],[3238,["did I ever mention those things to you","at all?"]],[3241,["Then why should you say things of the past?"]],[3243,["I have heard these things people just rake","it up and flung it back."]],[3248,["I have heard this kind of thing that they","bring it on other people, it’s not good."]],[3252,["One should be very gracious, very kind,"]],[3257,["and understand that everybody has","tremendous potentiality."]],[3263,["Respect, respect and respect. Respect","yourself and you’ll respect others."]],[3271,["I hope now you won’t have problem","of collectivity after this lecture,"]],[3275,["and if you have, you can listen to this","lecture again and again;"]],[3279,["and My special humble request that try","to curb down your angles."]],[3285,["Automatically other angles will calm down."]],[3291,["But if it is a non-Sahaja Yogi then you all","should fight it together."]],[3296,["All should join together if [it] is","a non-Sahaja Yogi."]],[3299,["Nobody dare torture you or trouble you.","Those days are gone now."]],[3304,["None of you will be troubled."]],[3310,["These are all satanic forces and they can","work through you also."]],[3315,["You must know when they give you such ideas","to fight and to quarrel."]],[3320,["Understand that this is anti-God. You are","doing God’s work."]],[3327,["You have to move towards more","understanding, more coordination;"]],[3332,["because this is such a tremendous work","and of such a sublime nature,"]],[3338,["that we have to be sublime ourselves."]],[3346,["All right, now is there any other question?","[It] was a very nice suggestion"]],[3352,["but don’t give Me such big suggestions","that I have to speak for half an hour."]],[3363,["Sahaja Yogini: Mother, when you say","collective consciousness,"]],[3366,["does that exclude all the people who are","not Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3371,["so does that mean that Sahaja Yogis are isolating","themselves"]],[3374,["from the 90% of the people who are not","Sahaja Yogis?"]],[3379,["Shri Mataji: What is she saying? I just","couldn’t hear. Can you come?"]],[3387,["You come here and tell Me. Yes, it’s","all right."]],[3391,["Sahaja Yogini: When you are talking about","being collectively conscious,"]],[3395,["that excludes the people who are not Sahaja","Yogis and therefore the Sahaja Yogis"]],[3399,["are isolating themselves from the people,","from the majority of the other people."]],[3402,["Shri Mataji: Oh, that’s it. No, no, no."]],[3405,["She says that when collectively Sahaja","Yogis become one"]],[3409,["then those who are not Sahaja Yogis","are isolated. It’s not so."]],[3413,["You see, Sahaja Yogis have to be strong","enough. Now take it like this,"]],[3418,["that there are people, say, who are","in the water"]],[3422,["and some people are in the boat, all right?"]],[3425,["Now the people who are in the boat are","in the boat, so they are in a way"]],[3431,["different from the people who are in the","water. That’s the situation is, all right?"]],[3435,["Now the people in the boat have to save","the people who are in the water, all right?"]],[3441,["So what I am saying that those who are","in the boat must first of all be united,"]],[3446,["and then with full strength pull them out.","Why this collectivity?"]],[3449,["Is just to pull out the rest of them.","This collectivity is just to achieve"]],[3457,["their emancipation, their realization,","all right? It doesn’t mean that"]],[3463,["they should exclude. Actually the whole","collectivity is to bring those people out."]],[3468,["But, you see, there are lots of anti-God","activities going on in this world,"]],[3474,["you know that. For example, there’s a guru","who makes lots of money, all right?"]],[3478,["And he has destroyed many people. Now","they come to Me and they are saved."]],[3483,["So he may send somebody here paid","for a job just to disturb us."]],[3488,["Then the duty of all the Sahaja Yogis is","to get together and see that,"]],[3491,["to tell him that, “You see, now you are","doing wrong."]],[3494,["Your guru has done wrong to us and he","is going to do wrong to others."]],[3498,["Why do you join with that?” On that point","everybody should be one."]],[3501,["But if they are not strong and if they are","not one, they cannot pull out others."]],[3506,["You see, My point is like that. Not","to exclude - is all,"]],[3510,["collectivity is to include everyone inside.","All right?"]],[3522,["I mean to say, there is no specialization","in Sahaja Yoga, in simple words."]],[3528,["Everybody is a doctor of everything."]],[3547,["I mean to say that all the Sahaja Yogis","must form a strong group"]],[3553,["by which they achieve enlargement","of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3558,["getting more people into Sahaja Yoga, more","people benefitted by Sahaja Yoga, all right?"]],[3565,["All - anywhere I have seen, wherever there","is collectivity, like I would say,"]],[3570,["Australia has the maximum collectivity,","or India of course it has, but Australia,"]],[3576,["in all the European countries, or I should","say the western-styled communities,"]],[3580,["Australia has the maximum collectivity and","they have achieved the maximum results."]],[3587,["Only in Sydney, today only, Warren told Me"]],[3591,["that the halls like this get packed","for programmes."]],[3597,["Melbourne, there is no room for new people","who are coming,"]],[3601,["and it’s such a big compound I’m amazed,","I mean, how many must be going there."]],[3605,["And it is because of collectivity.","And as soon as I went there"]],[3610,["it started gathering up. But before that","the people were fighting among themselves"]],[3615,["and many people ran away from Sahaja Yoga","because they thought,"]],[3618,["“These people are fighting, what are they","going to give us?”"]],[3622,["Maximum is in Australia, I think. Then is","Austria is having some problem there,"]],[3630,["and as soon as the problem came in,","the whole thing became a very small group."]],[3635,["Again that problem is over now; positivity","has come;"]],[3639,["the people have joined together; again","it has flourished."]],[3642,["It happens here also, we have seen."]],[3647,["Why Labor Party lost? If they had","not quarrelled"]],[3650,["they would not have been so badly off."]],[3656,["Is absolutely a simple equation,"]],[3661,["“United we stand,” isn’t it?"]],[3668,["Is there any other question?"]],[3679,["All right. So how many are new people","today here?"]],[3684,["Can you raise your hands please?","One, two, three, five, six."]],[3693,["All right. Can I request you to come","to the front seats?"]],[3697,["That will be better, will help Me","better too,"]],[3700,["because you are so much here and there,","all right? Just come, please."]],[3703,["Be comfortable. Yes, come along,","all of you."]],[3708,["Just be seated. Yes. Be comfortable."]],[3713,["Now get some more chairs."]],[3720,["Can you get some more chairs here","for the front seats?"]],[3725,["Douglas, can you put them in a line?"]],[3729,["They cannot be lifted; they are fixed,","are they? All right."]],[3756,["Now for all the new people I have to say","one thing,"]],[3760,["that, you see, you cannot argue it out."]],[3764,["It has to work within you. It has to work","within you. It’s a happening."]],[3769,["There is a force within you which we call","as Kundalini,"]],[3775,["which is the pure desire of becoming one","with the Spirit."]],[3783,["All other desires are impure. That’s why","you are never satisfied."]],[3788,["Now this desire is not yet awakened","within us."]],[3792,["This power of desire, or energy of desire,","resides in the sacrum bone"]],[3798,["and it has to be awakened, and when","it is awakened, it rises,"]],[3804,["passes through six centers, subtle centers,"]],[3808,["comes out of your medulla oblongata","into the brain"]],[3812,["and then, out of this part which was a soft","bone in your childhood,"]],[3819,["and you start feeling a cool breeze coming","out of your head,"]],[3824,["and a cool breeze coming out of your hands","also afterwards."]],[3829,["Now this is a living process, as you cannot","force a seed to sprout."]],[3836,["It sprouts by itself spontaneously, but you","have to put it in the Mother Earth."]],[3841,["In the same way it sprouts. It sprouts","spontaneously"]],[3852,["and when it happens then you have to see","for yourself."]],[3859,["One can help because if there is","an obstruction on any chakras,"]],[3864,["especially if the Nabhi chakra is","caught up,"]],[3867,["then what happens that on that center","the Kundalini tries to push"]],[3873,["and you can easily see with your naked","eyes the pulsation"]],[3877,["or the movement of your sacrum bone","just like a heart, just like a heart."]],[3883,["These things you cannot maneuver, you","cannot attain by effort."]],[3891,["Is a thing already settled there within you","and this has to be awakened."]],[3897,["Now what we can do is to try to remove","the hurdles that are there"]],[3904,["during the ascent of the Kundalini.","That’s all we can do."]],[3908,["But if it doesn’t work out, we can work out","again and we can work out again."]],[3914,["But you have to have patience with yourself","and you have to have understanding"]],[3921,["that you will get your realization.","It’s not so difficult."]],[3925,["All of these people who are sitting here","have got realization"]],[3928,["and most of them are settled down","with their realization."]],[3933,["They know what the chakras are, what","are the obstructions,"]],[3937,["how to remove the obstructions and how","to raise the Kundalini."]],[3941,["All this you will also know. All this","mastery you will also have,"]],[3946,["but you have to, as I said, you have","to have that earnestness"]],[3949,["and that kind of assiduity by which","you’ll achieve it."]],[3954,["So it is for us to raise your Kundalini and","it is for us to help you to achieve it."]],[3963,["Then once you have achieved it and you","have mastered it,"]],[3967,["it is for you to teach others and to give","realization to others."]],[3972,["It is as simple as that. So I’m sure","it will work out tonight"]],[3978,["and that all will work it out. We should","all cooperate with each other."]],[3984,["Now some people who are frightened,","I have to tell them"]],[3987,["there’s nothing to be frightened","in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3990,["Thousands of people have got realization","without any difficulty."]],[3993,["Or those who are still discussing in their","minds, must stop it now,"]],[3998,["because they have not found it; better","prepare yourself to have the realization."]],[4004,["It is not to be paid for. You cannot put in","any effort. Nothing can be done."]],[4009,["It has to work out, all right?"]],[4013,["With this understanding let us see that"]],[4017,["few things, whatever I tell you, you try","to cooperate with Me."]],[4020,["One of them is a simple thing, is to remove","your shoes. Please remove your shoes."]],[4024,["There’s nothing in the shoes, you see.","If you remove the shoes,"]],[4028,["you’ll become relaxed, little bit more,","and also I feel that it helps"]],[4034,["the Mother Earth to suck in problems","very well."]],[4039,["It’s a very simple method by which","it should work out."]],[4043,["So I would request you to put both your","hands towards Me, just like this,"]],[4049,["and close your eyes. That’s all. Just","close your eyes."]],[4061,["You will also know why I asked you to put","your hands towards Me later on."]],[4067,["So don’t think about it. There are five","fingers and six centers –"]],[4072,["and seven centers all on your hands, and","when you put your hands towards Me"]],[4078,["the message goes to the Kundalini","and it rises."]],[4081,["It’s your own, everything is your own.","Only thing like one enlightened light"]],[4085,["enlightens another light, I’m just","enlightening you"]],[4088,["and then you can enlighten others exactly","the same way."]],[4093,["All right. I would request you also to take","out your spectacles"]],[4097,["if you have any, because it helps your","eyesight also."]],[4100,["It helps your eyesight. Just take out","your spectacles."]],[4103,["Any other obstacle, anything that is little","bit uncomfortable,"]],[4109,["you can reduce the pressure on your waist","if it is very tight;"]],[4114,["or anywhere you feel the tightness you can","reduce."]],[4117,["Put both the feet on the ground, little","separate from each other"]],[4121,["because both feet have different problems,","are to be attended to differently."]],[4126,["Now please keep your eyes shut and I would","request you not to open your eyes"]],[4131,["till I tell you, because if your eyes are","open"]],[4135,["the Kundalini refuses to rise up to Agnya.","So please keep your eyes shut."]],[4144,["Just with complete faith in yourself"]],[4151,["you just wait and it will work out."]],[4155,["If it doesn’t work out, we’ll try to tell","you how you yourself can work it out"]],[4162,["by awakening your own centers."]],[4185,["You have to sit quietly."]],[4192,["Please put your right hand – don’t open","your eyes –"]],[4195,["please put your right hand on your heart."]],[4199,["Because the left hand is the hand","of your desire"]],[4203,["so it should be kept where it is now","throughout."]],[4207,["Only you have to move the right hand because","the right hand is the hand of action."]],[4215,["Now at this stage you have to say – if you","are wearing a coat"]],[4219,["put it from inside the coat, would be","better – hand on your heart"]],[4224,["and left hand towards Me on the lap,","comfortably."]],[4231,["Now you please in your heart, with all","sincerity"]],[4236,["you have to ask the question thrice,","“Mother, am I the Spirit?”."]],[4242,["Now why I say that you call Me Mother,","because you have to call Me"]],[4247,["Shri Mataji, which is a tongue twister","and I think it will be difficult."]],[4251,["So to make it easier, I say “Call Me","Mother”."]],[4264,["Please ask the question, “Mother, am I","the Spirit?”."]],[4274,["Because the Spirit has to come in your","attention; you have to become the Spirit."]],[4284,["Many people think if you pray without being","realized, God will do what you want."]],[4291,["He won’t, because you are not yet","connected. You have to be connected to God."]],[4295,["That’s why Christ has said you are to be","born again."]],[4299,["That’s not an artificial thing, it’s","a reality."]],[4305,["Now as the Spirit is your guide, it is your","guru, you don’t need any guide anymore,"]],[4313,["put this right hand down on the stomach","on the left hand side again,"]],[4319,["and push it a little. On your stomach","on the left hand side put the right hand"]],[4325,["and left hand towards Me, and push it","a little bit and say –"]],[4331,["you must put your hand on your stomach,","stomach on the left hand side"]],[4337,["and press it a little bit because there","lies – the right hand, the right hand,"]],[4344,["take it to the left side and put it","on the center on the left side."]],[4353,["And now you ask the question, “Mother,","am I my own guide?"]],[4360,["Am I my own master? Am I my own guru?”"]],[4363,["Ask the question ten times because there","are ten sub-plexuses within us."]],[4382,["Later on your own guru, which is your","own Spirit, will guide you"]],[4387,["because you’ll get vibratory awareness,","a new dimension in your awareness."]],[4392,["You’ll become collectively conscious."]],[4395,["You’ll become, again. It’s not just","a lecture but it is a happening."]],[4402,["Please ask ten times, “Mother, am I","my own guide? Am I my own guru?”."]],[4440,["Now again put the same right hand","on your heart"]],[4446,["and now you can assert by saying, “Mother,","I am the Spirit”."]],[4452,["Just say that. On the heart, on the heart,","put it on the heart,"]],[4459,["the right hand on the heart, where","the Spirit is,"]],[4462,["where it resides, is reflected","in your heart."]],[4466,["So just say, “Mother, I am the Spirit”,","with full assertion."]],[4477,["You have to say that twelve times."]],[4517,["Now as the Spirit is guiltless, it never","commits sins, it is blemishless,"]],[4526,["it is absolutely spotlessly clean,","sparkling diamond within you,"]],[4532,["you have to raise this right hand at the","base of the neck on the left hand side."]],[4537,["We have to move on the left hand side,","throughout."]],[4539,["At the base of the neck on the left hand","side. This is a very important center,"]],[4544,["very important center for the Western","people is through the neck,"]],[4551,["at the neck on the left hand side."]],[4559,["You put it on your shoulders on the left","hand side."]],[4564,["Just take it from the front, will be","easier, yes; and press it hard."]],[4568,["And at this center you have to say that,","“Mother, I’m not guilty,”"]],[4574,["sixteen times, because if you are","the Spirit, how can you be guilty?"]],[4580,["But really you must say, “I’m not guilty.”"]],[4583,["Get away from all ideas that you have done","this wrong or that,"]],[4588,["you have committed this sin and that sin."]],[4610,["“Mother, I’m not guilty.” Say it sixteen","times, please."]],[4621,["You are not guilty; you are just thinking","like that."]],[4625,["By thinking you have made yourself","miserable."]],[4630,["There’s not to feel guilty about anything."]],[4672,["Now raise the same hand on your forehead.","Across. On your forehead across."]],[4683,["At this point you have to forgive others.","This is the center of Christ."]],[4692,["He forgave the people who crucified Him."]],[4697,["In the same way you forgive everyone.","Forgive everyone."]],[4705,["Please forgive everyone. People say it is","difficult to forgive,"]],[4709,["but if you don’t forgive, actually what","you are doing"]],[4713,["is you are harming yourself, and not","the people who have harmed you."]],[4717,["So just say, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[4733,["From your heart. Whatever you are saying,","is working out."]],[4738,["So please say, “Mother, I forgive","everyone.”"]],[4742,["If you don’t say it from your heart,","it will have no effect."]],[4749,["Now put the hand on top of your head,"]],[4753,["where you had a soft bone, press it hard","with your palm."]],[4759,["And just move it a little bit, sideways","if you put it is easier,"]],[4766,["in a clockwise manner – your head,","your scalp – you can say."]],[4772,["At this point it is the liberation point,"]],[4778,["is that point where you get your moksha,","where you get your realization."]],[4783,["And I can’t cross your freedom. At this","point you have to say,"]],[4788,["“Mother, I want my realization, please","give me my realization”,"]],[4793,["at least seven times. Say it seven times."]],[4815,["[A] lot of a heat is coming out. That’s","a good thing. Let the heat come out."]],[4828,["Now raise the hand and see if there’s","a cool breeze"]],[4832,["or a hot breeze is coming out. First","the heat will come out."]],[4836,["You can change over your hand and see","with the other hand."]],[4839,["With the right hand towards Me, with","the right hand towards Me"]],[4842,["and [the] left hand on top and see if","there’s a cool breeze coming out."]],[4916,["You may change again your hand, whenever","you feel like"]],[4919,["you can change your hand, and see if","there’s a cool breeze coming out."]],[4927,["He’s got it. He’s a born realized.","No problem with him. He is!"]],[4937,["Let him feel yours."]],[4943,["Just feel him. On top, yes."]],[4950,["He’s got it?"]],[4960,["Their certificates are correct. If they","give you the certificate."]],[4968,["You have got it, long time back."]],[4974,["Have you felt it? Not yet. Don’t open","your eyes. Keep your eyes shut."]],[4979,["It will work out."]],[4983,["You exchange your hands one by one","and see for yourself."]],[4987,["Put your attention there and see. You have","to work it out yourself."]],[4992,["Don’t get disappointed and don’t feel bad","about it."]],[4995,["Just go ahead with it. It will work out."]],[5005,["Now I’ll ask some of the Sahaj Yogis","to come and see and help you."]],[5009,["Please come along. At the back of these","people, you know, those who are sitting,"]],[5013,["can you see for that – this little one can","find out about everyone."]],[5026,["Now here, keep your eyes shut. It will","work out."]],[5029,["Don’t you worry and don’t feel","disappointed."]],[5031,["It has to work out. It has to work out.","Did you feel the cool breeze?"]],[5035,["Good. You have felt it already. Good.","What about you? No?"]],[5040,["Why, why are you so dejected? It will","work out."]],[5047,["John? Just try this gentleman."]],[5052,["Now, don’t think about it, just you keep","in meditation."]],[5055,["He’s got it. The first one has got it.","[The] second gentleman."]],[5060,["Shri Mataji: Now, what’s your name?","Child: Anna. Shri Mataji: Anna."]],[5064,["Child: [Indistinct]"]],[5072,["Shri Mataji: Let’s have him here,","let’s have him here."]],[5074,["She’s going to America now, she’s going","to America."]],[5081,["[Indistinct]"]],[5093,["Hello, William, come along!"]],[5096,["Come up, come up, come up. Take some","chana."]],[5100,["Be careful! Be careful."]],[5105,["Come along. William? Come here."]],[5117,["What about his teeth? Yogini: Yes, he’s","already got two big teeth coming, Mother."]],[5121,["Shri Mataji: But how can he eat this, he","will eat? Can he manage? All right."]],[5136,["Come from this side, all right? For you may","fall. Now come from this side, all right?"]],[5140,["We’ll keep this one there. All right, now.","Now."]],[5153,["You take this. Do you want to have?"]],[5164,["Do you like it? Good! Will you have","some more?"]],[5168,["Will you have some more in your hand?","All right, you have it."]],[5173,["What about you? Will you have some more?","Child: More!"]],[5176,["Shri Mataji: More? Where is it going?","In your stomach?"]],[5186,["Now come along, come along. You have it."]],[5192,["You go then digest it there. Digest it."]],[5195,["Will you have this, first you eat that. Hm?"]],[5201,["Oh. Take this, take this. Throw it away."]],[5208,["Now, just come here. Come, come, come."]],[5215,["Who is that? …"]],[5225,["You all stand there… should not fall out."]],[5233,["Elizabeth? Will you have some more?"]]]);
